[
  {
    "RowId": 34269,
    "Text": "Defeat the silkie"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34270,
    "Text": "Clear the refuge of the powerful"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34271,
    "Text": "Defeat the gladiator of Sil'dih"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34272,
    "Text": "Defeat Shadowcaster Zeless Gah"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34273,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34300,
    "Text": "Clear the Way of the Wise"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34301,
    "Text": "Clear the River of Knowledge"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34302,
    "Text": "Clear the briny deep"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34303,
    "Text": "Clear the windward pass"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34304,
    "Text": "Clear the stairway to the seventh"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34305,
    "Text": "Clear the highest heaven"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34306,
    "Text": "I'll teach you the ways of navigation!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34307,
    "Text": "Mine are the waves and the winds!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34308,
    "Text": "Feel the might of the Navigator!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34309,
    "Text": "Like the stormy seas, I'm a harsh mistress!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34310,
    "Text": "Can you contend with she who rules the tides?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34311,
    "Text": "You must make an ally of the wind!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34312,
    "Text": "You're bloody brilliant, you are!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34313,
    "Text": "Rise above the whitecaps!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34314,
    "Text": "Boundless as the ocean!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34315,
    "Text": "Brace for the storm!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34316,
    "Text": "My trident parts the very seas!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34317,
    "Text": "Hahaha, well done!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34318,
    "Text": "You don't disappoint!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34319,
    "Text": "You can surely do better than that."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34320,
    "Text": "To seek new horizons, you must come together as one."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34321,
    "Text": "It falls to you and yours to navigate the seas ahead."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34322,
    "Text": "Come, Perykos! Thalaos!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34323,
    "Text": "Join us in the excitement!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34324,
    "Text": "Go on, my pets! Don't be shy!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34325,
    "Text": "I trust you don't mind if they play too."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34326,
    "Text": "That's the way, my clever serpents!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34327,
    "Text": "Go, Perykos!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34328,
    "Text": "A serpent after my own heart!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34329,
    "Text": "Swim free, my pet!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34330,
    "Text": "Go, Thalaos!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34331,
    "Text": "Yes, frolic to your heart's content!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34332,
    "Text": "Dance upon the waves!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34333,
    "Text": "Oi, cut it out, you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34334,
    "Text": "Come, mortals. Make your way through our watery sanctum."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34335,
    "Text": "Let us see how you fare against my servants."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34336,
    "Text": "Only to be expected for they who vanquished my pupil Byregot."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34337,
    "Text": "It shall be my pleasure to welcome you personally."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34338,
    "Text": "Smooth sailing so far, I see. Come, then, mortals!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34339,
    "Text": "All hands, prepare to set sail!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34340,
    "Text": "Time to put to sea!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34341,
    "Text": "Have you got the stones to face the Navigator?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34342,
    "Text": "Come on, don't keep me waiting!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34343,
    "Text": "Let me prepare a suitable stage for our union!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34344,
    "Text": "After all this time, it feels strange calling to you thus."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34345,
    "Text": "Thank you. For making it this far."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34346,
    "Text": "Not long now till our journey together must end..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34347,
    "Text": "I shall open the way forward."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34348,
    "Text": "Our clash has brought us closer to our true nature."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34349,
    "Text": "The finishing touches, we leave to you."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34350,
    "Text": "You're back! The Omphalos─it suddenly transformed..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34351,
    "Text": "Servants!? What's the meaning of this?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34352,
    "Text": "Those ones, I leave to you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34353,
    "Text": "It seems we're being summoned..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34354,
    "Text": "Go, my friend! I will stay here with the others!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34355,
    "Text": "So the time is come..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34356,
    "Text": "I am the last of us to face you."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34357,
    "Text": "Bask in the breath of the firmament!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34358,
    "Text": "Stand firm amidst the storm!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34359,
    "Text": "Gathering gusts, rise to the heavens!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34360,
    "Text": "Behold the Wanderer's arrow!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34361,
    "Text": "My bowstring sings!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34362,
    "Text": "Wind guide my arrow!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34363,
    "Text": "Those who hesitate are lost!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34364,
    "Text": "Stay not your steps!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34365,
    "Text": "Here our journey ends..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34366,
    "Text": "There!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34367,
    "Text": "You must persevere!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34368,
    "Text": "Arise!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34369,
    "Text": "Let all be equal!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34370,
    "Text": "Your prayers have given us strength."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34371,
    "Text": "Your prayers have given us strength. By fighting you, that strength shall be returned to the star."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34372,
    "Text": "Come, grant us our heart's desire!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34373,
    "Text": "Yes... Mankind has indeed grown strong."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34374,
    "Text": "You can overcome this─I know you can."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34375,
    "Text": "No more than I expected."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34376,
    "Text": "Give me cause to believe in mankind."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34377,
    "Text": "When this battle is over, I..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34378,
    "Text": "I'm glad that it was you who came to us."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34379,
    "Text": "Ahh, the sweet sorrow of parting..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34380,
    "Text": "I beg you, stay the course to the end!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34381,
    "Text": "Blessings be upon you on the road ahead."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34382,
    "Text": "May the wind ever be at your back."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34383,
    "Text": "Strong are they who roam!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34384,
    "Text": "Come, children. Fulfill our final wish."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34385,
    "Text": "See every last mote of us returned to the star!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34386,
    "Text": "By the power vested in us!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34387,
    "Text": "More!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34388,
    "Text": "Shine like the stars on high!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34389,
    "Text": "Mercy be upon our beloved children!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34390,
    "Text": "In unity lies resilience!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34391,
    "Text": "The only way is forward!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34392,
    "Text": "Overcome our final test!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34393,
    "Text": "In wisdom lies strength!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34394,
    "Text": "Fight! Fight with all your being!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34395,
    "Text": "Be strong, good children!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34396,
    "Text": "Receive of our love─and transcend it!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34397,
    "Text": "Ever has mankind hoped and prayed."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34398,
    "Text": "And those hopes and prayers have given us form."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34399,
    "Text": "Unto the star, we surrender our all!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34400,
    "Text": "Ahhh, you have truly come far..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34401,
    "Text": "Blessings be upon Etheirys."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34402,
    "Text": "Not a single mote of strength shall we hold back!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34403,
    "Text": "'Twas your faith that gave rise to this radiance!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34404,
    "Text": "The moon forms at Menphina's command!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34405,
    "Text": "The moon begins to wax..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34406,
    "Text": "Time accelerates at Althyk's command!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34407,
    "Text": "I have looked forward to this moment, children of man."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34408,
    "Text": "The Scholar shall measure your depth of knowledge."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34409,
    "Text": "O waters purifying, reveal their nature!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34410,
    "Text": "The rivers rage at my behest!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34411,
    "Text": "'Tis time for a test."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34412,
    "Text": "At what answer will you arrive, I wonder."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34413,
    "Text": "Seek new perspectives, and you shall find new paths."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34414,
    "Text": "Let flow the waters of your mind!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34415,
    "Text": "Prove to me the wisdom of man!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34416,
    "Text": "Of ignorance be cleansed!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34417,
    "Text": "Let us enlighten one another!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34418,
    "Text": "Not all knowledge is wisdom!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34419,
    "Text": "Share with me your ruminations."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34420,
    "Text": "Not all answers can be obtained through might."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34421,
    "Text": "Small wonder the others have exulted so."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34422,
    "Text": "Join me in deepest knowledge."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34423,
    "Text": "Well done, wise children. Well done."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34424,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34425,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34426,
    "Text": ""
