  {
    "RowId": 34600,
    "Text": "No! Do not look upon me! Leave now or...or...<i>DIE</i>."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34601,
    "Text": "Is this what became of the keyward? How dreadful..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34602,
    "Text": "She means to send you plummeting into the abyss. Allow me to soften your landing."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34603,
    "Text": "Perhaps you require more room for heroics."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34604,
    "Text": "Leave me to my research, or be...<i>become</i>..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34605,
    "Text": "I shall give you ground on which to fight, but you must move deftly!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34606,
    "Text": "She knows only destruction... I shall do my best to keep up with her rage!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34607,
    "Text": "Her anger is endless! It shall take time until you are under sure footing again..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34608,
    "Text": "Curses! We must hurry, lest they fall to their doom!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34609,
    "Text": "We have not lost yet. I shall lay more ground!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34610,
    "Text": "We must make a stand! Find your footing once more!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34611,
    "Text": "This is becoming routine. What crumbles, we rebuild!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34612,
    "Text": "Defeat Agdistis"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34613,
    "Text": "Begone from my sight or suffer...<i>SUFFER</i>!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34614,
    "Text": "I sense convergences of aether... Beware what they may spawn!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34615,
    "Text": "If you will not leave... Then <i>YOU</i> shall become <i>MINE</i>!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34616,
    "Text": "I am...Agdistis? Yes...and this is my vessel. Have I been gifted new test subjects?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34617,
    "Text": "It begins again. Fear not─I shall make new ground!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 34618,
    "Text": "I tire of this insolence. Troublesome <i>SPECIMENS</i> must be put down!"
  },
